{"id": "0007858_p0001", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 1, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=1", "text": "", "banxin": [], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": true, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0002", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 2, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=2", "text": "新道役屬甌駱至萬餘里竊\n僞號以自娛固一州之雄也\n漢遣陸賈掉三寸舌以王命\n讓佗佗惶恐頓首謝罪願世\n世爲蕃臣其後越相呂嘉有\n異志漢興十萬師討之令考\n伏波樓船諸將軍中國人其\n===\n將戈船下瀨出零陵發夜郎\n兵下牂牁江會番禺者則歸\n義侯馳義侯皆越人也是時\n降城賜印越既平矣獨呂嘉\n與其徒屬夜亡入海越郎都\n稽又從海上追獲嘉漢以爲\n功侯之人言越人易反側至", "banxin": ["武舉録序　二"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0003", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 3, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=3", "text": "平越之亂率多越人力也嗟\n乎豈誠越人力哉偏國長老\n不足以當漢埶也孝文以塡\n撫爲德故用一儒生不爲寡\n孝武以駕馭爲威故用十萬\n師不爲衆即越人能用武由\n漢天子能用越武人耳况我\n===\n皇祖初以傳檄定越不煩加兵今\n國家全盛之埶加漢已遠而我\n皇上智勇天錫威德流暨遐適尤\n非漢主之所能窺其視四方\n皆目中矣何有於越顧猶\n安不忘危日以守在四夷爲念\n元年虜犯汾石輒輟講", "banxin": ["武舉録序　三"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0004", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 4, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=4", "text": "諮問大臣得策乃已二年\n篤詣\n山陵謂虜在京師肩背\n詔飭邊將繕甲厲兵待之三年\n大閱營兵布昭\n神武旋遣司馬總戎平越寇而以\n帑金數萬爲輜巳又屢下\n===\n明詔舉謀臣羅力士錄武舉之\n三試者而將之\n聖天子宵旰封疆拊髀頗牧如是\n其急書曰克詰戎兵以覲耿\n光揚大烈其斯之謂乎迺者\n少司馬李公中丞殷公一時\n受鉞握重兵附衆威敵士氣", "banxin": ["武舉錄序　四"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0005", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 5, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=5", "text": "且殷殷奮矣今御史奉\n上德意來求士又非止爲越用夫\n士亦非止求用於越已也乃\n予意則以爲越新被寇即休\n馬息士而瘡痍未盡起餘孽\n未盡殄陰藏命作奸借軀始\n禍伏在桄林荔浦伺釁而動\n===\n者十郡而九也未敢遽以爲\n安諸士往見群醜肆亂何�review\n也頃見大兵討賊又何壯也\n能無感憤之心生乎嗟乎茲\n越人卧薪嘗膽時也比歲士\n就試率不滿五百人今至千\n人有奇有以激之故也拔三", "banxin": ["武舉錄序　五"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
