{"id": "0007858_p0008", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 8, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=8", "text": "臣奉大漢之威而無鉛刀一\n割之用乎夫得臣之爲楚重\n與定遠之自重於漢蓋必有\n所恃也豈汝諸士卒不能爲\n越有無哉予未之信矣錄成\n御史屬予併序其事以申告\n諸士姑不爲高論云\n===\n廣東等處承宣布政使司左\n布政使方弘靜謹序", "banxin": ["武舉錄序　八"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0009", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 9, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=9", "text": "", "banxin": [], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": true, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0010", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 10, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=10", "text": "擬合通行爲此仰抄捧呈堂照依案驗備\n去該部題奉\n欽依内事理幷行各道及叅遊守把府州縣衛\n所等衙門各將後開武舉鄉試條格一體\n欽遵查照施行\n計開\n一每遇子午卯酉年十月武舉鄉試\n預於九月内各衛所起送都司府\n州縣起送布政司類送巡按御史\n會同三司官考驗定數仍行都司\n起送五府轉送兵部布政司起送\n兵部兩京衛所俱送中府候到齊\n之日中府掌印官會同各府幷錦\n衣衛各掌印官考驗定數類送兵\n部直隷衛所留守司大寧萬全都\n司幷各府州縣俱各送巡按御史\n考驗定數仍行各都司直隷府州\n衛所照例起送其十月内考驗聞", "banxin": ["武舉録 二"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0011", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 11, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=11", "text": "期弁選取之法一倣武舉會試例\n行各處起送應武舉之人務要詢\n訪素無過犯操行端謹言貌出衆\n膂力過人及考驗弓馬熟閑答策\n通曉兵法者各開註明白方許以\n禮起送不許求足額數一槩濫舉\n正德十四年六月該兵部題本年\n十月例該武舉鄉試將合倣武舉\n會試所行事件開坐\n===\n一議得在京武舉鄉試照武學考驗\n例本部侍郎一員會同各府掌印\n官弁錦衣衛掌印官於團營東官\n廳南京兵部尚書會同南京各府\n掌印官弁南京錦衣衛掌印官於\n大教場各考驗都察院弁南京都\n察院各差監察御史一員監試在\n外布政司於所在教場或貢院考\n驗直隷去處弁各邊聽各該巡按", "banxin": ["武舉錄　三"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
{"id": "0007858_p0012", "tianyige_id": "0007858", "title": "隆慶四年廣東武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1570, "reign_era": "隆慶", "reign_year": 4, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "廣東", "province_en": "Guangdong", "page": 12, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007858_%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%E5%BB%A3%E6%9D%B1%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E9%9A%86%E6%85%B6%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=12", "text": "御史定議適中相應去處考驗兩\n京并各處武舉鄉試考驗等官并\n執事官軍終塲對策人員茶飯及\n合用紙劄筆墨心紅等項北京照\n舊例各營出辦南京聽南京兵部\n於本部收貯各項官銀内支給措\n辦在外聽各該巡按御史定擬於\n各都司布政司府衛量數出辦初\n塲二塲試箭合用金鼓旗號響器\n===\n并監箭巡視等官三塲搜檢巡綽\n官軍在京行三大營南京行大教\n塲定數差撥其刋刻題目匠役兩\n京俱於府縣取用在外聽各該巡\n按御史定撥取用及印卷彌封等\n項執事官俱照舊例初塲試馬上\n箭以三十五步為則二塲試步下\n箭以八十步為則各要彀弓平矢\n直衝把子中央者為中如有劄箭", "banxin": ["武舉錄 四"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
